2:["$","p","For landing pages, request negative space on a specific side. For mobile social ads, use a 4:5 or 9:16 composition with a strong central silhouette. Always check the platform’s current technical and policy requirements independently.",{"children":"For landing pages, request negative space on a specific side. For mobile social ads, use a 4:5 or 9:16 composition with a strong central silhouette. Always check the platform’s current technical and policy requirements independently."}]
3:["$","section","Quality-control before publishing",{"id":"s3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Quality-control before publishing"}],[["$","p","Zoom in on packaging text, corners, stitching, handles, ports and accessories. Compare color against a calibrated source. An attractive but inaccurate image can increase returns and damage trust.",{"children":"Zoom in on packaging text, corners, stitching, handles, ports and accessories. Compare color against a calibrated source. An attractive but inaccurate image can increase returns and damage trust."}],["$","p","Use AI for variation and early production, then use conventional editing for exact typography, legal copy, price badges and final color correction.",{"children":"Use AI for variation and early production, then use conventional editing for exact typography, legal copy, price badges and final color correction."}]]]}]
